// Level 5: "The Storm Isle", west of the arena, under the open sky (an original level built on
// battle-royale mechanics, for a Souls player). World metres (x east, y = world z growing south).
//
// Route: the arena's west door 60 → stairs up to the Causeway (the Lookout: sunflower 51) → the
// Storm Field. Step onto it and the storm ring starts closing on the eye in stages; outside it the
// storm burns. Loot chests in three tiers lie about the field (grey, violet, gold). The field's
// dwellers converge as the ring closes; at the eye, among standing stones, waits the Stormcaller.
(
    name: "The Storm Isle",
    px_per_m: 1.0,
    origin_px: (0.0, 0.0),
    origin_world: (0.0, 0.0),
    theme: Storm,
    sky: true,
    ceiling: Some(2.6),
    seed_base: 900,
    rooms: [
        (name: "The Causeway", floor: 2.0, rects: [(-46.0, -1.5, -30.0, 1.5)]),
        (name: "The Lookout", floor: 2.0, rects: [(-44.0, 1.5, -36.0, 8.0)]),
        (name: "The Storm Field", floor: 2.0, rects: [(-100.0, -30.0, -46.0, 30.0)]),
    ],
    stairs: [
        (rect: (-30.0, -1.5, -18.0, 1.5), down: East, top: 2.0, bottom: 0.0),
    ],
    doors: [
